abstract: >-
  A finite retrospective empirical methods research resource linking 22
  claim-estimand objects, 27 historical primary models and 23 absolute-effect
  sensitivities to implementation provenance and current inferential limits.
  Recoverable AVAglio rules and information-limited TRIO allocation identity are
  complementary cases, not independent validation of a general-purpose tool.
  Restricted participant-level inputs are not redistributed. Component licence
  scope is defined in LICENSE, LICENSE-DATA.md and LICENSING.md.
